к экрана · Дрэамитчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bc/Bandicam_2019-05-30_20-07-31-390.png/revision/latest?cb=20190606044925"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bandicam_2018-09-06_01-30-09-906.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6c/Bandicam_2018-09-06_01-30-09-906.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20180906135226","caption":"Снимок экрана · Дрэамитчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/6c/Bandicam_2018-09-06_01-30-09-906.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180906135226"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bandicam_2019-08-02_20-45-57-182.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/05/Bandicam_2019-08-02_20-45-57-182.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20190803004659","caption":"Снимок экрана · Дрэамитчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/05/Bandicam_2019-08-02_20-45-57-182.png/revision/latest?cb=20190803004659"}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-music-star-89a6a2","title":"Tamagotchi Music Star","ru":"Tamagotchi Music Star","kind":"device","note":""}]}